    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your creature type is undead, rather than humanoid. You also gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You count as a humanoid for the purpose of attacks, spells, and features that have no effect on undead.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on saving throws against being poisoned, and you have resistance to poison damage.</p></li><li><p>You don't need to eat, drink, or breathe.</p></li><li><p>You don't need to sleep, and magic can't put you to sleep</p></li></ul>",
